WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:09.890
Foolish pirates.

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:13.730
You'd knowingly attack
the invincible fleet

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:17.790
<i>commanded by Captain Usopp-sama
of the Going Merry?!</i>

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:22.330
Attack them, men! Attack!

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:36.520
<i>C'mon, you guys. Show some
interest in other people...</i>

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.010
All done!

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.490
Look! A pirate flag!

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:44.630
Now that Usopp's joined
and we have four people,

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.660
we need to have our own mark!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:51.430
<i>That's our mark?</i>

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:53.800
Whadya think? Nice, huh?!

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.570
A pirate flag is a symbol of death.
A symbol of fear!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.840
I do sense fear, though...
Fear of your talent.

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:05.550
<i>Wish you would've told me first!</i>

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:09.280
Don't forget about me,
the gifted artist!

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.190
Gifted artist?

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.590
I've drawn graffiti on walls
for 50 years straight!

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:16.560
When it comes to painting,
I'm in a league all my own!

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.430
Awesome! 50 years?!

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.900
That means he's an old man now!

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.530
Not only that, he must have
5 or 6 grandkids by now!

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.300
That's awesome, too!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.490
Hey!

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.210
Alright! Behold this work of art!

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.570
Tadah!

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:36.100
<i>Who told you to make your flag?!</i>

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.280
I guess that's more like it.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:43.280
Wow, it's pretty good!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.120
Yeah! It's good! I like it!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.690
So this is our mark...

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:51.830
Alright! Usopp!
Draw one on the sail, too!

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:52.920
Right!

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.030
Alright! All done!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:02.970
Now the Going Merry
pirate ship is all set!

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:14.740
<i>"You're the Weird Creature!
Gaimon and His Strange Friends."</i>

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:18.950
I'm pooped...

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:27.430
Is this the right way?
It seems kinda dangerous...

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.660
What?!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.820
Wait.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.900
That's it! That's the place!
No doubt about it!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:39.270
Do you see something neat?

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.080
The legendary Treasure Island.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:44.550
The legendary Treasure Island?
I've heard of that before!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.980
Yeah! It's a famous
island among pirates!

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:50.180
As are the weird stories about it...

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.120
Weird stories?

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:57.110
That whoever gets near the island
incurs a god's wrath...

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:05.600
W-were the rumors really true?!
Is this the god's wrath?!

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.700
That sounds kinda neat!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.100
Luffy! You're not thinking of-

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.770
We sure are!

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.280
Let's go! Treasure Island!

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:02.390
This is one creepy island!

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.360
Yeah?

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:09.630
It's said that an extraordinary treasure
rests somewhere on this island.

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:13.000
Supposedly, lots of pirates have
landed here in the past,

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.910
but they've all fled in terror
before they could even look for it.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.570
In terror?

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:26.250
Supposedly, one pirate's face
suddenly changed into a boar's face,

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:32.190
and another's mustache stretched
out and strangled him like snakes.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.790
That's not real, right?

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:37.520
Though I'm sure the stories
are exaggerated somewhat!

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:40.190
D-don't scare me like that!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.940
I'm hungry.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.930
I'm going to sleep.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.440
How can he sleep in
a creepy place like this?

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:58.110
Yeah. What kind
of nerves does he have?

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.560
What are you doing?! Don't scare me!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:15.400
N-no, I just thought I'd do
a little dance to liven things up!

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:18.420
See? See? See?

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.900
Stop that, Luffy...

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.270
W-what is this?!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.620
Leave...

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.620
Who's there?!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.760
Leave!

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:45.390
Where's it coming from?!

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:47.900
I am this island's protective god!

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.430
Leave this island at once
if you value your lives!

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:52.930
Protective god?

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:55.200
You guys're pirates, aren't you?

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.070
Yeah.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.370
Pirates, just as I thought.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.140
Why would a god ask something like that?

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:04.680
Listen! Just try taking another
step into the forest!

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:08.020
The instant you do, will you
receive my divine punishment

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:10.950
and meet your doom?!

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.420
How should I know?
Why are you asking me?

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:14.790
What's the deal?

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.160
This guy seems kinda weird.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:19.220
What did you say, straw hat boy?!

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:27.500
<i>W-what are these things?!</i>

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:34.440
Humans I completely transformed
when they came to look for treasure.

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:37.510
Then you really are a god?!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.250
Look at all these weird things...

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.650
Is this a lion?

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:43.810
Are you sure it's not a pig?

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.520
Oww! Oww! Oww!

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:50.090
W-what exactly are you?!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.260
I'm a rubber person!
I ate a Devil Fruit!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.860
Devil Fruit?! Don't be absurd!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.530
I heard rumors about them long ago
when I used to be a pirate, but...

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:00.130
When you used to be a pirate?

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:03.570
N-no! I'm not reminiscing
about old times at all!

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.410
No, I don't want to hear
about old times!

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:09.080
What're you talking about?
You're the one who said it!

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.480
<i>Are you really a god?!</i>

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:15.280
Shut up! If you won't leave,
then receive my divine punishment!

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.690
Now you've done it, God!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.800
H-how are you all right?!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.260
--There you are!
--Don't move!

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:31.700
I told you not to move!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.410
That can't be!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:42.240
Hey, God or whoever!
Pistols don't work on this guy!

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:44.310
But they surprise me,
so I don't like 'em!

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:47.180
M-monster!

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:49.080
O-over there!

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.550
Here it is. His pistol.

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:01.720
Where'd he go?

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.470
<i>What is this?</i>

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:10.270
This is a god?

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.770
It's moving!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:25.120
Stand me up, already!
I said stand me up!

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.420
He's a person!

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.690
Neat! Is he a scrub brush?

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:32.790
<i>What's so god-like about you?!
You thought you could trick us!</i>

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.360
Shut up! Stand me up, I say!

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.560
Don't act all big after
you've fallen over!

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.530
I- I'll let you go for today!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:41.700
Wait!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.200
Huh?!

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:54.870
Huh?!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.220
--Hey! Luffy!
--Luffy!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.410
There. You're all set.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.420
You're a pretty popular guy, God...

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:42.930
So you used these guys to scare off
everyone who came to the island?

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.300
But I've never seen a person stuffed
inside a treasure chest before!

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.240
Are you a boxed and sheltered son?

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.810
Yeah. I've been overly-pampered
since I was just a little boy...

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.570
Of course I'm not!

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:56.340
I can't get out of this box!

00:11:56.340 --> 00:12:01.650
I've been alone on this island
and in this box for 20 years now!

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.140
20 years?!

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.730
You've been all alone on
this island for 20 years?

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.730
My hair and mustache are
just as you can see.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:18.100
Even my eyebrows got connected...

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:21.770
It's also been 20 years since
I've conversed with anyone like this.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:25.040
Can you understand how painful this is?

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.910
--It seems ridiculous.
--What did you say?!

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:31.950
Oh, here you are...

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:36.080
You were asleep this whole time,
even after all that happened?!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.030
W-who's this guy?!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.760
Notice sooner.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.900
He's a guy stuffed in a treasure chest!

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.030
Are you a boxed and sheltered son?!

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:56.570
Yeah. I've been overly-pampered
since I was just a little boy...

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:57.940
Of course I'm not!

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.910
Don't do the same stupid gag twice!

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:02.280
Zoro! Gimme a hand!

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:03.040
Ouch! Ouch!

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:07.310
What are you doing?! Stop it!
You're pulling my head off!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:09.980
<i>You're right! You can't get out!</i>

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.420
Don't be crazy!

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.790
Because of my lack of
exercise over the years,

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.760
this treasure chest fits
together with my body now!

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:19.530
If you try to break it,
my body'll get destroyed, too!

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:22.660
He's a strangely annoying guy.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:25.330
But who are you guys?

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:29.940
<i>You're nothing like any of
the other pirates who've come here.</i>

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:33.170
I'm Luffy! The man who's gonna
be King of the Pirates!

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:34.640
W-what?!

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:38.050
I'm gonna be King of the Pirates
and get the One Piece!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.680
The One Piece?!

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:43.280
Don't tell me you're seriously
planning to enter the Grand Line?!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.690
We even have a chart of the Grand Line!

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:50.190
Don't take it lightly! That place
is Hell, or a graveyard!

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:55.160
I once saw pirates who'd managed
to escape from the Grand Line!

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:58.770
They looked almost like people
who had died and lost their souls!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.030
Something incredibly
horrific must've happened,

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:03.270
or they must've run into
monsters or something...

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:07.070
<i>Not a single one of them
even tried to speak.</i>

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:10.610
On top of that, rumors about the
One Piece spawn even more rumors,

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:13.050
so there's no telling
what's true or not!

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:16.250
Some 20 odd years since the start
of the Great Pirate Era,

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:21.590
the One Piece is already a dream
within a dream beyond a legend!

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:26.230
So which is the Grand Line?

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.860
<i>Dunno. Don't you know,
old scrub brush guy?</i>

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.100
I can't read sea charts one bit.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:34.330
Oh. Then we're the same.

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:37.170
That's not a pirate conversation!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:40.010
Anyways, even if we do
enter the Grand Line,

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:43.880
earning as much money as we can
then escaping is the best idea.

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:47.210
I will find the One Piece!
I have good luck!

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:49.780
Where does all that confidence
of yours come from?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:52.620
<i>I will get it! You'll see!</i>

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.610
Whatever you say...

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.490
You're the same...

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:02.560
<i>You're just like me; you even
look like me, like we're twins!</i>

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.830
How in the world does
he look like you?!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:08.200
I understand! Achieving
your dreams someday!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:11.270
We used to think the same way!

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.710
We?

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:15.910
We were willing to put our lives
on the line to search for treasure!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:19.710
It was that zeal that
changed my entire life!

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:21.280
W-wait. What do you mean?

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:27.850
It was 20 years ago. My fellow
pirates and I landed on this island.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.980
To find the treasure that
was said to rest here.

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:40.600
200 men have searched for a month now,
but it's no use!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:44.000
All we've found on this island
is this one empty treasure chest!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.240
We're leaving, men!

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:52.050
What're you doing, Gaimon?
We're going on ahead!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.210
Yeah.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.690
<i>Did anyone look up there?</i>

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:01.750
<i>The captain stayed down
here the whole month...</i>

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.790
<i>I'll check it out one last time!</i>

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:15.440
I couldn't believe my own eyes!

00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:18.710
I- I found it! It's up here!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:21.700
Hey! Guys!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.710
That's when I got stuck in the chest!

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:39.830
When I came to, my crew was
already far out to sea.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:42.630
Crap!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:48.900
Wait a minute! Does that mean
that fortune is all mine?!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.900
I can't climb up like this!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:54.500
I can't get out! I can't get out!

00:16:55.940 --> 00:17:00.110
Hey! Come back!

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.550
Even after all this time,

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:06.750
the fortune I only saw for
an instant has never left my mind.

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:10.560
Pirates have come to this island
in search of treasure countless times,

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:13.730
but I used these guys
to scare them all away.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:19.770
That's how I've protected
the treasure for 20 years now!

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:21.170
It's mine!

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:24.570
Yeah! No question about it!
It's yours!

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:30.310
<i>Alright, Gaimon-san!
We'll get the treasure for you!</i>

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.650
--R-really?!
--Yeah!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:33.950
Don't tell me you're gonna...

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.880
Aren't you a thief who
only steals from pirates?

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:38.750
How rude!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.750
Even I know what's
appropriate and what's not!

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:06.480
Here?

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.470
I haven't been here
for a while, myself.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:18.660
The time has finally come!
Today is a great day!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.190
I'm counting on you, Straw Hat!

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:22.190
Alright! Gum-Gum...

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.900
...Rocket!

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.630
Yes!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.850
W-well?! Is it there?!

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:46.890
What's he doing?

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:47.990
Luffy!

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:51.890
--Hey! Luffy!
--What the heck's going on?!

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:57.230
I found 'em! Six treasure chests!

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:59.360
W-well done!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:05.110
I finally got it!
The treasure! The treasure!

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:09.140
Toss my treasure down here!

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:10.810
--Hurry! Hurry!
--No.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:13.210
What?!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.950
No! I don't wanna toss it down!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:19.220
What nonsense is this?!
Quit joking around!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:25.090
<i>Yeah! That treasure belongs
to Gaimon-san! Toss it all down!</i>

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.330
Quit clowning around, you!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.900
It's all right.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:36.170
--It doesn't matter anymore.
--Of course it does!

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:41.710
<i>Yeah! You've guarded that treasure
for 20 years, Gaimon-san!</i>

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:43.940
Straw Hat. You're...

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:47.080
...a great guy!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.280
What do you mean?

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:53.820
I had a slight inkling
that might be the case...

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:58.320
I tried to avoid thinking
about it, but...

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:01.020
They're empty, aren't they?

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:05.570
Yeah. They're all empty.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.530
That's terrible...

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:10.840
The treasure he guarded for
20 years was just empty boxes...

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:15.980
It happens all the time with treasures
that have treasure maps...

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.980
You go to look, but someone's
already stolen it.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:23.280
That's how much of an ordeal
treasure-hunting is for pirates.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:27.620
You can wait all your life, or lose
your life, and never touch treasure...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:31.020
There are more pirates like
that than you can count!

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:35.330
Don't be so upset, old guy!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.930
It's a good thing
we came after 20 years!

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:41.870
30 years later and you
might've been dead!

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:43.470
Straw Hat...

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.470
--Luffy...
--He's...

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:47.310
You've made this much
of a fool of yourself!

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:52.580
All you got left now is the One Piece!
Come be a pirate again with us!

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:57.320
<i>You're... inviting me?!</i>

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:02.890
No one's even tried to talk to me
before when they saw me like this!

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:06.380
How many years it's been
since I trusted someone!

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.000
Thank you...

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:28.850
You're really gonna stay
on this island, old guy?

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.080
Yeah, Straw Hat.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:34.290
Even if there is no treasure, there's
something else I want to protect.

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:38.360
--Eh?
--Something you want to protect?

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:42.330
I've shared hard times and happy
times with these guys for 20 years.

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:44.920
I can't leave them now.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:56.980
Now that I know there's no treasure,
I somehow finally feel free.

00:21:56.980 --> 00:22:00.380
I think I can really live
a life I want now.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.650
Plus, I've actually grown
a bit fond of being in this box!

00:22:03.650 --> 00:22:07.190
Oh! That's too bad, then!
You're a neat old guy, too!

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:09.920
So the weird creatures
are your true friends...

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:12.160
He's the weirdest creature
of them all, though!

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:14.390
Say what?!

00:22:23.100 --> 00:22:26.510
See ya! Take care!

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:28.670
Bye!

00:22:31.210 --> 00:22:32.850
Straw Hat...

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:36.750
Strive for your dream, for me.

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.750
You, if anyone, will surely get

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:44.190
the legendary treasure,
the One Piece!

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:49.860
And then... buy the world!

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:24:02.560
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
